  ],
  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The foundational nucleus instance segmentation and classification model — MIT licensed, 712 stars, Medical Image Analysis 2019, pretrained on CoNSeP/PanNuke/MoNuSAC. Introduced the HoVer map technique for separating touching nuclei, which influenced all subsequent nucleus segmentation work including StarDist and CellViT. Widely used as a baseline and production model for cell-level analysis in computational pathology pipelines.",
